[00:00.000]作曲 : AM FRIENDS
[00:01.510][Verse]
[00:01.909]Time will only tell
{"时间终会给出答案"}
[00:04.570]If you'll be on my side
{"你是否会站在我这边"}
[00:07.051]I was under your spell
{"我曾被你深深迷惑"}
[00:10.241]But I'mma be alright
{"但我终将走出阴霾"}
[00:12.425]You only call me when you want me
{"你只在需要时才想起我"}
[00:14.118]But you never even said you're sorry
{"却连一句抱歉都不曾说"}
[00:18.329]I'm not thinking that you are the one
{"我不再认为你是命中注定"}
[00:20.260]'Cause all of these emotions got me comin' undone
{"因为这些情绪让我逐渐崩溃"}
[00:23.279][Chorus]
[00:24.590]What do you want from me?
{"你到底想从我这里得到什么？"}
[00:26.398]What do you, what do you want from me, huh?
{"你究竟　你究竟想要什么？"}
[00:29.833]Why can't you let me be?
{"为什么不肯放过我？"}
[00:32.081]Why can't you, why can't you let me be, huh?
{"为何就是　为何不能让我解脱？"}
